{%- comment -%}
  Model photography for the 30 products in the November 2026 spreadsheet.
  Match full product handles so similarly named pieces keep their own embroidery.
  Accepts: product, width (optional), only_model (no original-image fallback).
  Output is one image URL; prices, variants, product media and product data stay native.
{%- endcomment -%}
